            "x": 64,
            "y": 176,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 224,
            "content": "## Test data assumptions\n\n- Runs against the **first** Xero organisation of the bound account (`ListTenants` items[0]).\n- Creates a supplier contact with a per-run unique name and a DRAFT purchase order dated today (delivery +7 days).\n- Cleanup after `AfterAll`: the purchase order is set to `DELETED`, the supplier is `ARCHIVED`.\n- The account needs the granular `accounting.invoices` (+ `.read`) and the `accounting.contacts` scopes; an account connected before these components existed must be reconnected."
        }
